      "updated": 1795249656911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Expo / React Native\n\nSign-in screen (Clerk email code)\nClerk keeps the session token\n\napi/index.ts:  call(token, path)\nAdds the token to every call\nBase URL: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL\n\nReact Query asks again every 60 s\nFirst call is /me: creates the\nuser's row on first sign-in",
      "originalText": "Expo / React Native\n\nSign-in screen (Clerk email code)\nClerk keeps the session token\n\napi/index.ts:  call(token, path)\nAdds the token to every call\nBase URL: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL\n\nReact Query asks again every 60 s\nFirst call is /me: creates the\nuser's row on first sign-in",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
